<title>JAPAN: NIDEC - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>NIDEC - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 36.54		vs	   31.89</p>
<p> Operating	    1.85		vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Current		2.64		vs	    1.82</p>
<p> Net		    1.43		vs	    1.25</p>
<p> EPS		   63.34 yen	  vs	   55.34 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     23 million	  vs	  23 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - NIDEC Corp manufactures spindle motors for hard disk drives and has a major share of the world market.</p>
